            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Emm, I’m working on a new completion engine  that refactors both the C and Lua parts, and this is part of it. I’ve been splitting the implementation into smaller PRs recently.  It resolves many current completion issues. So, I might reject this PR.  It also supports file and identifier completion.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"977\" height=\"506\" alt=\"616096ee-fb46-4f95-9ca2-0435bdde9b5c\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/808a3c0a-845a-4d7d-a8ba-e83e94b3e165\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n",
